	<content type="text/html" mode="escaped">Author: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.smspower.org:443/forums/profile.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=601&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;haroldoop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
	Posted: Tue Nov 03, 2026 10:00 am (GMT 0)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span class="postbody"&gt;
